    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl Me Blues is a <strong>fast-paced</strong> <strong>chaotic</strong> <strong>party game</strong> where one player tries to secure an objective while the others are attempting to get rid of him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle your friends online or locally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, no unfair advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/f45e7d5c1e80a41de33e584bebe32a24.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blends platformer with CTF elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got the flag? Survive. Nothing? Spread chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/327a8dae188f3055e808c33f1492c186.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features multiple maps with unique mecanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/31a39f21e1595a8bba1c5233fb7c6a77.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online multiplayer via Steam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can support multiple players on the same computer while playing online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/2f1cfdebd454c999dad7aa6f210f9eb9.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl Me Blues is a <strong>fast-paced</strong> <strong>chaotic</strong> <strong>party game</strong> where one player tries to secure an objective while the others are attempting to get rid of him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle your friends online or locally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, no unfair advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/f45e7d5c1e80a41de33e584bebe32a24.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blends platformer with CTF elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got the flag? Survive. Nothing? Spread chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/327a8dae188f3055e808c33f1492c186.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features multiple maps with unique mecanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/31a39f21e1595a8bba1c5233fb7c6a77.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online multiplayer via Steam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can support multiple players on the same computer while playing online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786030/extras/2f1cfdebd454c999dad7aa6f210f9eb9.avif?t=1750189580\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
